# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository, whatever the contributor's
# platform or core.autocrlf setting. Without this, a Windows clone can rewrite
# summary_templates/*.md to CRLF, which then reaches the model prompts and shows
# up as spurious whole-file diffs when that machine commits.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary formats that must never be touched by newline conversion.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.sqlite binary
